    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Deathwatch Support",
    "summary": "Combat Doctrines unlock these tactics for friendly KILL TEAM units that have this rule. Furor Tactics gives their weapons [SUSTAINED HITS 1] in devastator doctrine. Malleus Tactics gives their weapons [LETHAL HITS] in tactical doctrine. Purgatus Tactics gives their weapons [PRECISION] when their target is an enemy within 9″ in assault doctrine. You may include up to 500 points of DEATHWATCH units, which cannot provide your WARLORD. This Detachment provides Enhancements for KILL TEAM units.",
